hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20865","Hushaym narrated to us, Ibn Awn informed us, a man of the desert people narrated to us, from his father, from his grandfather, that he performed Hajj with a relative of his, coupled with him, so the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saw him and said: What is this? He said: It is a vow, so he commanded the coupling rope to be cut."
